====== 2. Timing Result of HLS-generated IP Core (top-level module: bypass_hw_top) ======

+--------------+---------------+-------------+-------------+----------+-------------+
| Clock Domain | Target Period | Target Fmax | Worst Slack | Period   | Fmax        |
